sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Customer Website
    participant API as Node.js API
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL
    participant A as Admin Panel
    participant W as WhatsApp Provider

    C->>API: GET /bookings/:ticketId
    API->>DB: Read booking and payment state
    DB-->>API: paid_confirmed, no driver assigned
    API-->>C: Booking confirmed and no driver options shown

    A->>API: GET /ops/admin/bookings?status=paid_confirmed
    API->>DB: Query paid bookings
    DB-->>API: Paid booking queue
    API-->>A: Booking details for authorized admin

    A->>API: PATCH /ops/admin/bookings/:id/assign
    Note over A,API: Admin manually selects a driver from internal records.
    API->>DB: Verify paid_confirmed state and write assignment
    DB->>DB: Store driver, optional vehicle, admin, note, timestamp
    DB-->>API: driver_assigned
    API-->>A: Assignment saved

    A->>API: POST /ops/admin/bookings/:id/notify-driver
    API->>DB: Load approved driver contact projection
    API->>W: Send WhatsApp template to verified customer
    W-->>API: Provider message ID and delivery status
    API->>DB: Record notification attempt and audit event
    API-->>A: Notification queued or delivered

    C->>API: GET /bookings/:ticketId
    API->>DB: Read verified booking and approved contact details
    DB-->>API: driver_assigned and contact projection
    API-->>C: Driver basic details and booking information

    Note over C,A: Customer never selects a driver or vehicle.
    Note over API,DB: There is no driver app, driver login, GPS, or live tracking.
